WEBVTT

00:08.896 --> 00:09.000
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.689 --> 00:10.827
KIDS:
Aye, aye, Captain.
儿童：
是的，是的，船长。

00:12.724 --> 00:12.862
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:14.482 --> 00:14.620
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:15.896 --> 00:16.000
♪ Ooh!
♪ 哦！

00:19.034 --> 00:19.172
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.931 --> 00:21.034
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪

00:23.034 --> 00:23.172
♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.896 --> 00:25.000
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪

00:27.034 --> 00:27.172
♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
♪ 如果是航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:28.896 --> 00:29.000
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪

00:30.758 --> 00:30.896
♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:33.000 --> 00:33.103
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪Ready?
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪ 准备好了吗？

00:34.896 --> 00:35.000
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:36.862 --> 00:36.965
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:39.034 --> 00:39.172
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:40.793 --> 00:40.931
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:44.551 --> 00:44.689
[ hearty laughter]
[爽朗的笑声]

00:46.517 --> 00:46.655
[ piccolo playing]
[短笛演奏]

00:49.172 --> 00:49.310
[ ocean waves lapping,
seagulls crying]
[海浪拍打着，
海鸥在哭泣]

01:04.448 --> 01:04.586
So, I was all ready
to drain the fries,
所以，我已经准备好了
沥干薯条，

01:07.206 --> 01:07.344
but I cooked the fries
slightly too long. So...
但我煮了薯条
有点太长了。所以...

01:10.896 --> 01:11.000
SpongeBob...So here's where the
bizarre twist comes in.
海绵宝宝...所以这就是
奇怪的转折出现了。

01:13.172 --> 01:13.310
SpongeBob...They weren't overcooked
at all!
海绵宝宝...他们没有煮过头
根本！

01:15.379 --> 01:15.517
SpongeBob! Look!
海绵宝宝！看！

01:18.310 --> 01:18.448
SPONGEBOB:
Wow!
海绵宝宝：
哇！

01:19.862 --> 01:19.965
What happened to
the Krusty Krab?
发生了什么事
蟹堡王？

01:22.000 --> 01:22.137
MR. KRABS:
Good morning!
先生。螃蟹：
早上好！

01:23.758 --> 01:23.896
The Krusty Towers
is now open for business.
库斯蒂塔
现已开始营业。

01:27.000 --> 01:27.103
Why did you build a hotel,
Mr. Krabs?
为什么要建酒店，
蟹老板？

01:28.724 --> 01:28.862
I'm glad
you asked, son.
我很高兴
你问了，儿子。

01:30.620 --> 01:30.758
Remember when I went to
that fast food convention
记得我去的时候
那个快餐大会

01:32.310 --> 01:32.448
and stayed in
that fancy hotel?
并留在
那个豪华酒店？

01:34.620 --> 01:34.758
I had a beautiful room.
我有一个漂亮的房间。

01:36.655 --> 01:36.793
The employees were so friendly.
员工们非常友好。

01:40.482 --> 01:40.620
They catered to me every whim,
他们满足了我的每一个突发奇想

01:42.379 --> 01:42.517
no matter how demeaning it was,
不管它是多么有辱人格，

01:44.655 --> 01:44.793
because they lived by a code.
因为他们遵循一套准则。

01:47.034 --> 01:47.172
And that code was engraved
in fine gold
那段代码被刻在了
纯金

01:49.241 --> 01:49.379
above the grand fireplace.
大壁炉上方。

01:56.827 --> 01:56.965
Everything was perfect.
一切都很完美。

01:59.413 --> 01:59.551
Until I got the bill!
直到我收到账单！

02:01.551 --> 02:01.689
They charged me for everything.
他们向我收取一切费用。

02:03.172 --> 02:03.310
$25.00 for a hamburger.
汉堡包 25 美元。

02:06.379 --> 02:06.517
[ horn toots]
[喇叭嘟嘟]

02:10.310 --> 02:10.448
If they could charge
that much for
a lousy burger,
如果他们可以充电
就这么多
一个糟糕的汉堡，

02:12.586 --> 02:12.724
imagine how much
I could charge for
a lousy Krabby Patty.
想象一下有多少
我可以收费
一个糟糕的克拉比帕蒂。

02:15.689 --> 02:15.827
And thus,
因此，

02:17.137 --> 02:17.275
the Krusty Towers
was born.
库斯蒂塔
诞生了。

02:19.758 --> 02:19.896
Why would anyone stay at a hotel
in Bikini Bottom?
为什么有人要住酒店
在比基尼底部？

02:22.689 --> 02:22.827
It's in the middle
of scenic nowhere.
它在中间
风景无处。

02:25.172 --> 02:25.310
There's nothing to do
but get stung by jellyfish.
无事可做
但被水母蜇了。

02:27.551 --> 02:27.689
[ groaning]
[呻吟]

02:28.724 --> 02:28.862
See?Eww.
看到了吗？呃。

02:30.413 --> 02:30.551
Come inside.
进来吧。

02:33.620 --> 02:33.758
Isn't it beautiful?
是不是很漂亮？

02:35.310 --> 02:35.448
Where are all the new
hotel employees?
所有新的都在哪里
酒店员工？

02:42.655 --> 02:42.793
Me first hotel guest.
我是第一个酒店客人。

02:45.000 --> 02:45.103
Watch me reel him in.
看我把他卷进去。

02:48.310 --> 02:48.448
Welcome to
the Krusty Towers,
欢迎来到
库斯蒂塔，

02:50.172 --> 02:50.310
where our motto is,
我们的座右铭是，

02:51.517 --> 02:51.655
"We shall never deny a guest
“我们永远不会拒绝客人

02:53.068 --> 02:53.206
even the most ridiculous
request."
即使是最可笑的
请求。”

02:55.172 --> 02:55.310
Oh, that's great.
哦，那太好了。

02:56.551 --> 02:56.689
I'd like a double Krabby Patty
我想要一份双层蟹肉饼

02:58.137 --> 02:58.275
with no onions
and extra pickles.
没有洋葱
和额外的泡菜。

02:59.689 --> 02:59.827
If you want
a Krabby Patty,
如果你想要
蟹肉饼，

03:01.586 --> 03:01.724
you have to rent a room,
and order room service.
你必须租一个房间，
并订购客房服务。

03:03.172 --> 03:03.310
Ooh, I've only got
an hour for lunch.
哦，我只有
一个小时的午餐。

03:05.758 --> 03:05.896
Boy, you reeled
that one in like a pro.
男孩，你晕倒了
那个就像专业人士一样。

03:08.551 --> 03:08.689
Okay, Squidward,
好吧，章鱼哥，

03:10.413 --> 03:10.551
you run
the front desk.
你跑
前台。

03:12.758 --> 03:12.896
I'd like
a Krabby Patty, please.
我想要
请来一份蟹肉饼。

03:15.206 --> 03:15.344
This is a hotel now.
这里现在是一家酒店。

03:17.068 --> 03:17.206
If you want
a Krabby Patty,
如果你想要
蟹肉饼，

03:19.172 --> 03:19.310
you'll have to get
a room, and order
room service.
你必须得到
一个房间，并订购
客房服务。

03:21.275 --> 03:21.413
Okay.
One Krabby Patty and one room.
好的。
一份蟹肉饼和一间房间。

03:23.724 --> 03:23.862
With cheese.
配奶酪。

03:25.551 --> 03:25.689
Oh, and can I get cheese
on the Krabby Patty, too?
哦，我可以买奶酪吗
也吃蟹黄饼吗？

03:27.206 --> 03:27.344
Patrick,
帕特里克，

03:28.655 --> 03:28.793
you only live
400 yards away.
你只活着
400 码外。

03:30.344 --> 03:30.482
Why do you want
to check into a hotel?
你为什么想要
入住酒店？

03:32.206 --> 03:32.344
Sometimes I just need to get
away from it all.
有时我只需要得到
远离这一切。

03:36.310 --> 03:36.448
Wow, this hotel
has everything.
哇这个酒店
拥有一切。

03:37.620 --> 03:37.758
Give me that.
给我那个。

03:39.034 --> 03:39.172
Now sign
the register.
现在签名
寄存器。

03:40.655 --> 03:40.793
I didn't know
there would be a test.
我不知道
将会有一个测试。

03:41.793 --> 03:41.931
I didn't study!
我没学过！

03:43.655 --> 03:43.793
Patrick, all you have
to do is write your name.
帕特里克，你拥有的一切
要做的就是写下你的名字。

03:47.000 --> 03:47.103
Oh, okay.
哦好的。

03:49.896 --> 03:50.000
Do you mind?
你介意吗？

03:53.275 --> 03:53.413
Don't look.
别看。

03:56.275 --> 03:56.413
Um...
嗯...

03:57.724 --> 03:57.862
Done.
完毕。

04:00.931 --> 04:01.034
Close enough.
足够接近。

04:02.344 --> 04:02.482
Here's your
room key.
这是你的
房间钥匙。

04:04.000 --> 04:04.137
I'll need some help
with my bags.
我需要一些帮助
带着我的包。

04:06.137 --> 04:06.275
How can you
have bags?
你怎么可以
有包吗？

04:07.793 --> 04:07.931
You just found out
this is a hotel.
你刚刚发现
这是一家酒店。

04:08.965 --> 04:09.068
This is a hotel?
这是酒店？

04:10.275 --> 04:10.413
D-oh!
SpongeBob?
噢！
海绵宝宝？

04:12.344 --> 04:12.482
Yes, Squidward.
是的，章鱼哥。

04:14.000 --> 04:14.137
Take Patrick and his bags
to his room.
带上帕特里克和他的包
到他的房间。

04:16.000 --> 04:16.137
What about my Krabby Patty?
我的蟹黄饼呢？

04:17.551 --> 04:17.689
And bring him a Krabby Patty.
给他带一份蟹肉饼。

04:20.103 --> 04:20.241
Squidward, you can take
Patrick's bags up to his room.
章鱼哥，你可以带
帕特里克把行李搬到他的房间。

04:23.344 --> 04:23.482
SpongeBob, you go make
the Krabby Patty.
海绵宝宝，你去创造吧
蟹肉饼。

04:25.448 --> 04:25.586
Oh, Mr. Krabs.
哦，蟹老板。

04:27.034 --> 04:27.172
What's the matter?
怎么了？

04:28.586 --> 04:28.724
Afraid of a little
manual labor?
害怕一点点
体力劳动？

04:30.448 --> 04:30.586
"I'm Squidward, and I have
to work for a living."
“我是章鱼哥，我有
为了谋生而工作。”

04:33.724 --> 04:33.862
Boo-hoo-hoo.
呜呼呼。

04:35.206 --> 04:35.344
Fine.
美好的。

04:36.586 --> 04:36.724
Let's go,
Patrick.
我们走吧，
帕特里克.

04:37.965 --> 04:38.068
[ groaning]
[呻吟]

04:42.620 --> 04:42.758
This elevator is
for guests only.
这台电梯是
仅供客人使用。

04:45.413 --> 04:45.551
Take the employee
elevator.
拿员工来说
电梯。

04:47.103 --> 04:47.241
[ squeaking]
[吱吱声]

04:53.000 --> 04:53.103
[ bell rings]
[铃声响起]

04:55.931 --> 04:56.034
[ angry muttering]
[愤怒的嘀咕]

04:57.551 --> 04:57.689
[ bell rings]
[铃声响起]

05:01.448 --> 05:01.586
What's in
these bags? Rocks?
里面有什么
这些袋子？岩石？

05:04.344 --> 05:04.482
Hey, these are rocks!
嘿，这些是石头！

05:05.931 --> 05:06.034
Why is your suitcase
full of rocks?
为什么你的行李箱
充满了岩石？

05:07.827 --> 05:07.965
I don't tell you
how to live your life!
我不告诉你
如何过你的生活！

05:10.586 --> 05:10.724
Well, here's your room.
嗯，这是你的房间。

05:12.206 --> 05:12.344
Wow.
哇。

05:13.310 --> 05:13.448
Enjoy your stay.
祝您住宿愉快。

05:15.344 --> 05:15.482
Squidward, wait.
章鱼哥，等等。

05:18.344 --> 05:18.482
Keep up the good work,
继续做好工作，

05:20.137 --> 05:20.275
and there will be more
where that came from.
并且还会有更多
那是从哪里来的。

05:22.551 --> 05:22.689
Your Krabby Patty, sir.
你的蟹肉饼，先生。

05:25.000 --> 05:25.103
Hey, Squidward,
cool rock.
嘿，章鱼哥，
很酷的摇滚。

05:27.517 --> 05:27.655
Hold on a second,
SpongeBob.
等一下，
海绵宝宝。

05:29.310 --> 05:29.448
Here you are,
my good man.
你在这里，
我的好人。

05:32.172 --> 05:32.310
Thank you, Patrick.
谢谢你，帕特里克。

05:34.172 --> 05:34.310
There's plenty more where that
came from, my good friend.
还有很多地方
来自，我的好朋友。

05:36.896 --> 05:37.000
[ grumbling]
[抱怨]

05:38.241 --> 05:38.379
Squidward!What now?
章鱼哥！现在怎么办？

05:39.931 --> 05:40.034
I don't like crusts
on my sandwich.
我不喜欢面包皮
在我的三明治上。

05:42.448 --> 05:42.586
It's a bun.
这是一个馒头。

05:43.655 --> 05:43.793
It's all crust.
都是地壳。

05:45.379 --> 05:45.517
How am I supposed to cut
the crust off a bun?
我该怎么剪
面包皮掉下来了吗？

05:46.689 --> 05:46.827
Peel it.
剥皮。

05:52.034 --> 05:52.172
Happy?Yay!
快乐吗？耶！

05:53.965 --> 05:54.068
SPONGEBOB:
Room service.
海绵宝宝：
客房服务。

05:55.620 --> 05:55.758
Here's the 50 Krabby Patties
you ordered.
这是 50 个蟹黄肉饼
你订购了。

05:57.241 --> 05:57.379
Could you do
one more thing for me?
你能做吗
对我来说还有一件事吗？

05:59.758 --> 05:59.896
Why don't you ask
SpongeBob?
你为什么不问
海绵宝宝？

06:01.793 --> 06:01.931
Good idea,
Squidward.
好主意，
章鱼哥。

06:03.034 --> 06:03.172
How may I serve you, sir?
先生，我该如何为您服务？

06:04.931 --> 06:05.034
I need you to eat these
Krabby Patties with me.
我需要你吃这些
蟹肉饼和我一起。

06:06.689 --> 06:06.827
Oh, yes, sir.
哦，是的，先生。

06:10.931 --> 06:11.034
[ bell rings]
[铃声响起]

06:12.206 --> 06:12.344
Uh-huh.
Hold on.
嗯嗯。
坚持，稍等。

06:13.862 --> 06:13.965
Squidward! Patrick
needs your help.
章鱼哥！帕特里克
需要你的帮助。

06:15.275 --> 06:15.413
What?!
Why didn't he ask me
什么？！
他为什么不问我

06:16.965 --> 06:17.068
before I walked all the way
downstairs?
在我走完全程之前
楼下？

06:18.655 --> 06:18.793
He said he didn't
want to bother you.
他说他没有
想打扰你。

06:20.689 --> 06:20.827
But he got over it.
但他克服了。

06:25.931 --> 06:26.034
Hooray!
万岁！

06:27.172 --> 06:27.310
Thanks, Squidward.
谢谢，章鱼哥。

06:30.137 --> 06:30.275
[ toilet flushes]
[马桶冲水]

06:31.655 --> 06:31.793
Mr. Krabs,
this is ridiculous.
蟹老板先生，
这太荒谬了。

06:34.137 --> 06:34.275
Patrick's being completely
unreasonable.
帕特里克完全是
不合理。

06:36.655 --> 06:36.793
He can be as unreasonable
as he wants.
他也可以如此不讲道理
如他所愿。

06:39.862 --> 06:39.965
The plaque, Squidward!
The plaque!
牌匾，章鱼哥！
牌匾！

06:41.482 --> 06:41.620
But Mr. Krabs...
但是蟹老板...

06:42.827 --> 06:42.965
Deny no guest!
不谢客！

06:45.172 --> 06:45.310
[ phone rings]
[电话响]

06:46.413 --> 06:46.551
Well, hello, Patrick.
嗯，你好，帕特里克。

06:48.137 --> 06:48.275
You need Squidward
to come up right away?
你需要章鱼哥
马上上来吗？

06:51.000 --> 06:51.137
He'll be
right there.
他会是
就在那里。

06:53.517 --> 06:53.655
A bubble bath?
泡泡浴？

06:55.068 --> 06:55.206
Why would I give you
a bubble bath?
我为什么要给你
泡泡浴？

06:57.551 --> 06:57.689
Well, because Mr. Krabs
said you would.
嗯，因为蟹老板
你说你会的。

07:00.655 --> 07:00.793
Be sure to make my back
extra shiny clean.
一定要让我回来
格外闪亮干净。

07:04.000 --> 07:04.137
That's it!
就是这样！

07:05.206 --> 07:05.344
I've had enough!
我已经受够了！

07:06.758 --> 07:06.896
Squidward, wait!
章鱼哥，等等！

07:08.103 --> 07:08.241
The toilet's backed up again!
厕所又堵了！

07:09.862 --> 07:09.965
Hey, hey, you can't
take that elevator.
嘿嘿嘿你不能
乘那个电梯。

07:12.586 --> 07:12.724
You're an employee.
你是一名员工。

07:13.896 --> 07:14.000
Not anymore.
不再。

07:15.413 --> 07:15.551
I quit.
我不干了。

07:16.862 --> 07:16.965
Quit?
辞职？

07:18.000 --> 07:18.103
You can't quit.
你不能放弃。

07:24.034 --> 07:24.172
Welcome to
the Krusty Towers.
欢迎来到
库斯蒂塔。

07:25.344 --> 07:25.482
Squidward?!
章鱼哥？！

07:26.965 --> 07:27.068
One room, please,
on the top floor.
请一间房，
在顶楼。

07:29.896 --> 07:30.000
What do you think
you're doing?
你觉得怎么样
你在做什么？

07:31.000 --> 07:31.137
I need a vacation.
我需要一个假期。

07:32.172 --> 07:32.310
I'm overworked.
我劳累过度了。

07:34.000 --> 07:34.137
And what better place to relax
than Krusty Towers,
还有什么更好的放松场所
比库斯蒂塔，

07:37.965 --> 07:38.068
where we shall never deny
a guest
我们永远不会否认
一位客人

07:41.000 --> 07:41.103
even the most ridiculous
request.
即使是最可笑的
请求。

07:42.620 --> 07:42.758
I don't have to rent you a room.
我不必给你租房间。

07:45.586 --> 07:45.724
I got cash.
我有现金。

07:47.448 --> 07:47.586
D-oh...
Here's your room key.
噢……
这是你的房间钥匙。

07:49.482 --> 07:49.620
SpongeBob, carry my things
to my room.
海绵宝宝，帮我搬东西
到我的房间。

07:52.103 --> 07:52.241
Aye, aye, guest sir.
是啊是啊，客人先生。

07:56.034 --> 07:56.172
[ crashes]
[崩溃]

07:57.586 --> 07:57.724
And you can carry me
to my room.
你可以载着我
到我的房间。

08:01.034 --> 08:01.172
And why in tarnation
would I do that?
为什么在塔尼翁中
我会那样做吗？

08:03.413 --> 08:03.551
You've got four legs
that aren't broken.
你有四条腿
没有损坏。

08:05.586 --> 08:05.724
The plaque.
牌匾。

08:08.482 --> 08:08.620
Too bad we couldn't take
the elevator,
可惜我们不能接受
电梯，

08:11.137 --> 08:11.275
but it is for guests only,
and you are an employee.
但仅供客人使用，
而你是一名员工。

08:15.241 --> 08:15.379
Your room, sir.
你的房间，先生。

08:16.931 --> 08:17.034
And I'd like to order
room service.
我想订购
客房服务。

08:18.896 --> 08:19.000
I'd like a Krabby Patty
with cheese, toenail clippings
我想要一份蟹肉饼
配奶酪、脚趾甲屑

08:22.068 --> 08:22.206
and nose hairs.
和鼻毛。

08:23.206 --> 08:23.344
[ squeals]
[尖叫声]

08:24.551 --> 08:24.689
You've got to be kidding me!
你一定是在开玩笑吧！

08:26.137 --> 08:26.275
And I want it here
in five seconds.
我想要它在这里
五秒钟后。

08:27.172 --> 08:27.310
Yes, sir.
是的，先生。

08:28.344 --> 08:28.482
Here you are, sir.
在这里，先生。

08:30.413 --> 08:30.551
Well, you got
your stinky sandwich.
好吧，你得到了
你的臭三明治。

08:32.379 --> 08:32.517
Now eat it.
现在吃吧。

08:33.931 --> 08:34.034
Oh, I'm not going
to eat this.
哦，我不去
吃这个。

08:35.965 --> 08:36.068
You are.
你是。

08:37.000 --> 08:37.137
What?!
什么？！

08:39.000 --> 08:39.137
You're out of your mind if you
think I'm going to eat that.
如果你疯了，你就疯了
我想我要吃那个。

08:40.655 --> 08:40.793
Psst, that's not really
a Krabby Patty
嘘，那不是真的
蟹肉饼

08:42.655 --> 08:42.793
with cheese, toenails
and nose hair.
配奶酪、脚趾甲
和鼻毛。

08:45.000 --> 08:45.137
[ chuckles]:
Now I get you, boy.
[轻笑]：
现在我明白你了，孩子。

08:47.724 --> 08:47.862
All right, Squidward.
好吧，章鱼哥。

08:55.000 --> 08:55.137
[ laughter]
[笑声]

08:56.965 --> 08:57.068
SpongeBob!Sorry, Mr. Krabs.
海绵宝宝！对不起，蟹老板。

08:58.379 --> 08:58.517
We were all out
of cheese.
我们都出去了
奶酪。

08:59.862 --> 09:00.034
Hooray!
万岁！

09:01.310 --> 09:01.448
[ phone ringing]
[电话铃声]

09:02.896 --> 09:03.000
What is it,
Squidward?
这是什么，
章鱼哥？

09:04.862 --> 09:04.965
Send up a dozen cookies
just like mother used to make.
发送一打饼干
就像妈妈以前做的那样。

09:09.034 --> 09:09.137
Here's your homemade cookies.
这是你自制的饼干。

09:12.758 --> 09:12.896
These don't taste anything
like mom used to make.
这些没有什么味道
就像妈妈以前做的那样。

09:15.551 --> 09:15.689
Well, how did your mother
make 'em?
嗯，你妈妈怎么样？
让他们？

09:17.413 --> 09:17.551
How should I know?
我怎么知道？

09:18.758 --> 09:18.896
Ask my mother.
问我妈妈。

09:23.896 --> 09:24.000
[ doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

09:25.000 --> 09:25.137
Hello.
你好。

09:26.827 --> 09:26.965
[ gasps]
[喘气]

09:32.000 --> 09:32.103
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

09:42.655 --> 09:42.793
No good, Mr. Krabs.
不好，蟹老板。

09:44.448 --> 09:44.586
Allow me, boys.
请允许我，孩子们。

09:46.862 --> 09:46.965
Great.
伟大的。

09:48.551 --> 09:48.689
Now that me laundry
is in the trunk...
现在我洗衣服
在后备箱里...

09:50.172 --> 09:50.310
There's room for you
to sit up front.
有你的空间
坐在前面。

09:51.827 --> 09:51.965
Let's go bake some cookies,
boys.
我们去烤一些饼干吧
男孩们。

09:53.275 --> 09:53.413
Hooray!
万岁！

09:54.655 --> 09:54.793
Well?
出色地？

09:55.758 --> 09:55.896
I'm impressed.
我印象深刻。

09:57.482 --> 09:57.620
These are just like mother
used to make.
这些就像妈妈一样
用来制作。

09:59.206 --> 09:59.344
I just wish mom
was a better cook.
我只希望妈妈
是一个更好的厨师。

10:00.724 --> 10:00.862
So you're all taken care of.
所以你们都被照顾了。

10:03.206 --> 10:03.344
Just one teensy, tiny problem.
只是一个很小的问题。

10:06.034 --> 10:06.172
This room is hideous.
这个房间很丑陋。

10:07.310 --> 10:07.448
Redesign it.
重新设计它。

10:08.724 --> 10:08.862
Neptune the 14th would be nice.
海王星14宫会很好。

10:09.793 --> 10:09.931
What?
什么？

10:11.241 --> 10:11.379
"We shall never deny
a guest
“我们永远不会否认
一位客人

10:12.827 --> 10:12.965
even the most
ridiculous request."
甚至是最
可笑的要求。”

10:23.448 --> 10:23.586
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

10:24.655 --> 10:24.793
Perfect!
完美的！

10:26.448 --> 10:26.586
This room is exactly
the same as when we started!
这个房间正是
和我们刚开始的时候一样！

10:29.586 --> 10:29.724
Nothing like getting
back to the basics.
没有什么比得到
回到基础。

10:31.931 --> 10:32.034
Let's get out of here,
SpongeBob.
我们离开这里吧
海绵宝宝。

10:33.344 --> 10:33.482
Oh, before you leave,
哦，在你离开之前，

10:34.689 --> 10:34.827
I want to go swimming.
我想去游泳。

10:36.137 --> 10:36.275
The pool is out back.
泳池就在后面。

10:37.724 --> 10:37.862
[ laughing]:
Are you crazy?
[笑]：
你疯了吗？

10:39.310 --> 10:39.448
I'm not going outside to swim.
我不会去外面游泳。

10:41.517 --> 10:41.655
Come on in.
进来吧。

10:43.103 --> 10:43.241
The water's fine.
水还好啊

10:47.655 --> 10:47.793
Anything else stupid
还有什么蠢事

10:49.344 --> 10:49.482
and unreasonable
that you want?
和不合理的
你想要什么？

10:50.517 --> 10:50.655
Nope, that's it.
不，就是这样。

10:52.275 --> 10:52.413
You don't need me to chew
your food for you,
你不需要我咀嚼
你的食物给你，

10:54.413 --> 10:54.551
or make you a back scratcher
out of my own spine?
或者让你挠背
出于我自己的脊椎？

10:57.482 --> 10:57.620
Or maybe extinguish the sun
或者也许熄灭太阳

10:59.137 --> 10:59.275
so the light
don't get in your eyes?
所以光
不要进入你的眼睛吗？

11:01.275 --> 11:01.413
No, I'm good.
不，我很好。

11:02.655 --> 11:02.793
Me, too.
我也是。

11:03.655 --> 11:03.793
Wow!
哇！

11:05.620 --> 11:05.758
An indoor pool.
一个室内游泳池。

11:07.172 --> 11:07.310
This place is fancy!
这个地方很别致！

11:10.379 --> 11:10.517
Cannonball!
炮弹！

11:13.896 --> 11:14.000
[ laughing]
[笑]

11:15.137 --> 11:15.275
[ loud crash]
[巨响]

11:26.379 --> 11:26.517
MR. KRABS:
Oh!
先生。螃蟹：
哦！

11:28.103 --> 11:28.241
That hotel was a bad idea
from the start.
那家酒店是个坏主意
从一开始。

11:30.241 --> 11:30.379
That was a hotel?
那是一家酒店？

11:31.965 --> 11:32.068
Your bill, sir.
你的账单，先生。

11:33.482 --> 11:33.620
$15,000?
15,000 美元？

11:36.551 --> 11:36.689
You're not going to have
a heart attack, are you?
你不会有
心脏病发作了，你是吗？

11:38.586 --> 11:38.724
Not at these prices.
不是按照这些价格。

11:40.344 --> 11:40.482
Forget hotels.
忘记酒店吧。

11:42.310 --> 11:42.448
This hospital racket
is where the money is.
这家医院的球拍
就是钱所在。

11:44.310 --> 11:44.448
This is a hospital?
这是医院？

11:45.724 --> 11:45.862
Pack your bags, boys.
收拾好行李，孩子们。

11:47.413 --> 11:47.551
You're going
to medical school.
你要去
到医学院。

11:49.931 --> 11:50.034
Hooray!
Hooray!
万岁！
万岁！

11:51.172 --> 11:51.310
Oh, boy.
哦，男孩。

12:03.724 --> 12:03.862
Good morning, Mrs. Puff.
I'm Mr. Fitz.
早上好，普芙夫人。
我是菲茨先生。

12:06.103 --> 12:06.241
I represent the Voting Teachers
Accreditation Bureau.
我代表投票的老师
认证局。

12:09.206 --> 12:09.344
As you know, your teaching
certificate is up for renewal.
如您所知，您的教学
证书即将更新。

12:12.551 --> 12:12.689
However,
we've noticed there have been
然而，
我们注意到有

12:14.620 --> 12:14.758
an unusually large amount
of failings from this classroom.
数额异常大
这间教室的失败。

12:18.448 --> 12:18.586
That's impossible.
那是不可能的。

12:19.793 --> 12:19.931
In all my years of teaching,
在我多年的教学生涯中，

12:21.620 --> 12:21.758
only one student
has failed my class.
只有一名学生
我的课不及格。

12:24.344 --> 12:24.482
Yes, but he's failed
1,258,056 times.
是的，但是他失败了
1,258,056 次。

12:28.517 --> 12:28.655
SPONGEBOB:
Ai-ai-ai-ai-ai-ai!
海绵宝宝：
哎哎哎哎哎！

12:30.724 --> 12:30.862
You don't understand.
你不明白。

12:32.241 --> 12:32.379
SpongeBob is... unteachable.
海绵宝宝是……不可教的。

12:34.965 --> 12:35.068
We cannotblame the students for
the incompetence of the teacher.
我们不能责怪学生
老师的无能。

12:39.655 --> 12:39.793
SPONGEBOB:
Honk, honk!
Beep-beep!
海绵宝宝：
喇叭，喇叭！
嘟嘟！

12:41.034 --> 12:41.172
I'm ready to drive!
我准备开车了！

12:42.344 --> 12:42.482
[ horn honks]
[喇叭鸣响]

12:44.482 --> 12:44.620
Are you ready for
my driving test
today, Mrs. Puff?
你准备好了吗
我的驾驶考试
今天，普芙女士？

12:46.482 --> 12:46.620
Okay, Mrs. Puff,
if SpongeBob fails this test,
好吧，普芙女士，
如果海绵宝宝没有通过这个测试，

12:50.862 --> 12:50.965
you will be replaced.
你将会被取代。

12:54.000 --> 12:54.137
Okay, SpongeBob,
let's demonstrate for Mr. Fitz
好吧，海绵宝宝，
让我们为菲茨先生演示一下

12:57.517 --> 12:57.655
everything I've taught you
in boating school.
我教给你的一切
在划船学校。

13:00.379 --> 13:00.517
[ chuckles]:
Now,
[轻笑]：
现在，

13:02.241 --> 13:02.379
what's the first thing we do
before we start boating?
我们做的第一件事是什么
在我们开始划船之前？

13:04.758 --> 13:04.896
Oh! Seatbelt-a-rooni.
One second.
哦！安全带-a-rooni。
一秒钟。

13:07.620 --> 13:07.758
[ grunting]
[咕噜声]

13:15.000 --> 13:15.103
Then what do you do?
那你怎么办？

13:17.655 --> 13:17.793
Start the engine?Yes.
启动发动机？是的。

13:19.241 --> 13:19.379
[ engine starts]
[发动机启动]

13:22.241 --> 13:22.379
What do I do now?Drive the boat.
我现在该怎么办？驾驶船。

13:31.896 --> 13:32.000
Did I pass this
time, Mrs. Puff?
我通过了吗
时间到了吗，普夫夫人？

13:34.034 --> 13:34.172
No, SpongeBob.
不，海绵宝宝。

13:35.413 --> 13:35.551
You failed.
你失败了。

13:36.827 --> 13:36.965
I failed?
我失败了？

13:38.448 --> 13:38.586
It is not you that's
failed, SpongeBob.
那不是你
失败了，海绵宝宝。

13:40.931 --> 13:41.034
It's Mrs. Puff
that's failed you.
这是泡芙夫人
那让你失败了。

13:43.482 --> 13:43.620
You are relieved
of your teaching duties.
你放心了
你的教学职责。

13:45.896 --> 13:46.000
I won't be teaching
SpongeBob anymore?
我不会教书
现在还有海绵宝宝吗？

13:48.310 --> 13:48.448
[ laughing]
[笑]

13:51.172 --> 13:51.310
[ laughing loudly]
[大声笑]

13:53.827 --> 13:53.965
No more... SpongeBob?
不再...海绵宝宝？

13:56.655 --> 13:56.793
I thought this day
would never come.
我以为这一天
永远不会来。

13:58.448 --> 13:58.586
[ continues laughing]
[继续笑]

14:00.310 --> 14:00.448
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

14:01.689 --> 14:01.827
Good-bye, SpongeBob!
再见，海绵宝宝！

14:03.793 --> 14:03.931
Have a nice life.
祝你生活愉快。

14:05.965 --> 14:06.068
Free at last!
终于自由了！

14:07.655 --> 14:07.793
Free at last!
终于自由了！

14:14.655 --> 14:14.793
SPONGEBOB:
I got Mrs. Puff fired.
海绵宝宝：
我把普夫太太解雇了。

14:17.000 --> 14:17.137
[ booming footsteps]
[轰隆隆的脚步声]

14:21.655 --> 14:21.793
Hello, worthless students.
你好，无用的学生。

14:26.137 --> 14:26.275
I'm your new instructor.
我是你们的新教练。

14:28.689 --> 14:28.827
No one's ever failed my class
我的课从来没有人不及格

14:31.206 --> 14:31.344
that's lived through it.
那是经历过的。

14:33.448 --> 14:33.586
I can assure you,
these next four weeks
我可以向你保证，
接下来的四个星期

14:36.275 --> 14:36.413
will be the worst years
of your miserable lives.
将是最糟糕的几年
你悲惨的生活。

14:39.103 --> 14:39.241
Your spines will break.
你的脊椎会折断。

14:40.620 --> 14:40.758
Your teeth will ache.
你的牙齿会痛。

14:42.206 --> 14:42.344
Your eyes will be bloodshot.
你的眼睛会布满血丝。

14:44.000 --> 14:44.137
[ students whimpering]
[学生抽泣]

14:46.241 --> 14:46.379
You will drive
out of this school in style,
你会开车
以时尚的方式走出这所学校，

14:49.137 --> 14:49.275
or you will be carted out
否则你会被赶出去

14:51.206 --> 14:51.344
in your granny's
handbasket.
在你奶奶家
手提篮。

14:53.655 --> 14:53.793
Everyone will follow
the rules of the class.
大家都会跟着
班级规则。

14:56.068 --> 14:56.206
First rule: no talking.
第一条规则：不许说话。

14:58.862 --> 14:58.965
Does that mean...
这是不是意味着...

15:01.931 --> 15:02.034
Second rule:
no eating in my class.
第二条规则：
我的课上不许吃东西。

15:05.034 --> 15:05.172
Would anyone care for a bon-bon?
有人会喜欢糖果吗？

15:09.413 --> 15:09.551
Uh, I'll eat one.
呃，我就吃一个。

15:11.034 --> 15:11.172
[ students gasp]
[学生喘气]

15:12.620 --> 15:12.758
Pick your favorite.
选择你最喜欢的。

15:18.103 --> 15:18.241
How's it taste?
味道怎么样？

15:20.103 --> 15:20.241
It's a delightful
taste sensation.
这是一个令人愉快的
味觉感觉。

15:22.724 --> 15:22.862
No eating in my classroom!
不准在我的教室里吃东西！

15:26.103 --> 15:26.241
Now, if anyone else
is man enough
现在，如果还有其他人
够男人吗

15:28.000 --> 15:28.137
to stay in this class...
留在这个班级...

15:31.517 --> 15:31.655
Looks like you're
the man... Sponge.
看来你是
这个男人……海绵。

15:33.724 --> 15:33.862
I am?
我是？

15:35.793 --> 15:35.931
Do you want to learn
how to drive or what?Yes, sir!
你想学吗
如何开车还是什么？是的，先生！

15:39.275 --> 15:39.413
I'm ready to drive!
我准备开车了！

15:40.896 --> 15:41.000
What do you think
you're doing?
你觉得怎么样
你在做什么？

15:42.586 --> 15:42.724
Ready for my test, sir.You're not ready
准备好接受我的测试了，先生。你还没准备好

15:44.379 --> 15:44.517
to drive yet-- until
you learn thatfirst.
还可以开车——直到
你先学那个。

15:48.137 --> 15:48.275
This is the most grueling
driving course ever devised.
这是最累人的
曾经设计过的驾驶课程。

15:51.758 --> 15:51.896
You will learn every turn,
bump and crack on it.
每一个回合你都会学到，
其上有碰撞和裂纹。

15:55.896 --> 15:56.000
You'll start out
crawling it.
你将开始
爬行它。

15:57.689 --> 15:57.827
Crawl?
爬行？

15:59.620 --> 15:59.758
Hup two, hup two,
hup two, hup two!
哈二哈哈二，
哈二哈，哈哈二！

16:02.482 --> 16:02.620
Left turn!
左转！

16:04.206 --> 16:04.344
Crack! Bump! Nickel!
裂缝！撞！镍！

16:05.586 --> 16:05.724
Hey, a nickel!
嘿，五分钱！

16:07.517 --> 16:07.655
Keep your eyes on the road,
cadet![ gasps]
眼睛要一直盯着路，
学员！[喘气]

16:09.793 --> 16:09.931
SPONGEBOB:
Pebble!
海绵宝宝：
卵石！

16:11.448 --> 16:11.586
Whoa-whoa-whoa-whoa
whoa-whoa-whoa!
哇-哇-哇-哇
哇-哇-哇！

16:15.000 --> 16:15.103
Ow...!
哎呀……！

16:17.103 --> 16:17.241
Wow...!
哇...！

16:19.275 --> 16:19.413
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

16:21.379 --> 16:21.517
Wow...!
哇...！

16:24.586 --> 16:24.724
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

16:26.206 --> 16:26.344
Wow...!
哇...！

16:28.034 --> 16:28.172
Aah...!
啊啊……！

16:30.379 --> 16:30.517
[ sighs]:
Whew!
[叹气]：
哇！

16:33.034 --> 16:33.172
I'm ashamed
of you, cadet.
我很羞愧
你，学员。

16:36.620 --> 16:36.758
Tripped up by a wee pebble.
被小石子绊倒了。

16:39.000 --> 16:39.137
What are you supposed to
be learning in my class?
你应该做什么
在我的课堂上学习吗？

16:40.965 --> 16:41.068
How to drive, sir?
先生，怎么开车？

16:42.724 --> 16:42.862
Affirmative.
But before you learn to drive,
肯定。
但在你学会开车之前

16:45.241 --> 16:45.379
you must learn
to crawl.
你必须学习
爬行。

16:47.000 --> 16:47.103
And then you
learn to walk,
然后你
